      "index": null,
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Create a playable Snake game that runs in my web browser.\n\nUse the arrow keys to control the snake. Eating food makes it\ngrow and adds one point. Hitting a wall or the snake’s own body\nends the game.\n\nInclude a visible score, a Start button, a Restart button, and\nshort instructions. Use a clear, colourful design.\n\nCreate it using plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript in the src\nfolder. It must work by opening src/index.html directly, without\ninstalling packages or starting a server. Do not use external\nservices or save player data.\n\nCreate the files, check what you can, and explain how I can open\nand play the game in simple language.",
      "originalText": "Create a playable Snake game that runs in my web browser.\n\nUse the arrow keys to control the snake. Eating food makes it\ngrow and adds one point. Hitting a wall or the snake’s own body\nends the game.\n\nInclude a visible score, a Start button, a Restart button, and\nshort instructions. Use a clear, colourful design.\n\nCreate it using plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript in the src\nfolder. It must work by opening src/index.html directly, without\ninstalling packages or starting a server. Do not use external\nservices or save player data.\n\nCreate the files, check what you can, and explain how I can open\nand play the game in simple language.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "snake-workshop-7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 965,
      "y": 265,
      "width": 835,
      "height": 32.5,
