      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "snake-workshop-28",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 2370,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 52.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 221732,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 99988,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 0,
      "created": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": null,
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Ask for one change, then play again. / Bitte um eine Änderung und teste erneut.\nExample: make the snake slower; keep the other rules. / Beispiel: langsamer, gleiche Regeln.",
      "originalText": "Ask for one change, then play again. / Bitte um eine Änderung und teste erneut.\nExample: make the snake slower; keep the other rules. / Beispiel: langsamer, gleiche Regeln.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "snake-workshop-29",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 100.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 229651,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 103559,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 0,
      "created": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": null,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "“Make the snake move more slowly so the game is easier for beginners.\nKeep the other rules unchanged.”\n„Lass die Schlange langsamer laufen, damit das Spiel für Anfänger leichter ist.\nLass die anderen Regeln unverändert.“",
      "originalText": "“Make the snake move more slowly so the game is easier for beginners.\nKeep the other rules unchanged.”\n„Lass die Schlange langsamer laufen, damit das Spiel für Anfänger leichter ist.\nLass die anderen Regeln unverändert.“",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "snake-workshop-30",
      "type": "text",
